{
  "extension_point": "identity_provider_ui:provider",
  "mode": "append",
  "priority": 100,
  "components": [
    {
      "comment": "시작 전 상태 — provider_id=nhnkcp && !providerInProgress",
      "type": "basic",
      "name": "Div",
      "if": "{{_global.identityChallenge?.provider_id === 'nhnkcp' && !(_global.identityChallenge?.providerInProgress)}}",
      "props": {
        "className": "space-y-4"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "comment": "헤더 — 아이콘 + 제목 + 안내",
          "type": "basic",
          "name": "Div",
          "props": {
            "className": "flex-center flex-col text-center space-y-2 pt-2"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "basic",
              "name": "Div",
              "props": {
                "className": "inline-flex items-center justify-center w-14 h-14 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/40 rounded-full"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "basic",
                  "name": "Icon",
                  "props": {
                    "name": "mobile-screen",
                    "className": "text-2xl text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "comment": "성인인증 purpose 전용 제목",
              "type": "basic",
              "name": "H3",
              "if": "{{_global.identityChallenge?.purpose === 'nhnkcp.adult_verification'}}",
              "props": {
                "className": "section-heading-md"
              },
              "text": "$t:sirsoft-verification_nhnkcp.modal.adult_title"
            },
            {
              "comment": "기본 본인확인 제목 (signup/password_reset/self_update/sensitive_action 등)",
              "type": "basic",
              "name": "H3",
              "if": "{{_global.identityChallenge?.purpose !== 'nhnkcp.adult_verification'}}",
              "props": {
                "className": "section-heading-md"
              },
              "text": "$t:sirsoft-verification_nhnkcp.modal.title"
            },
            {
              "comment": "성인인증 purpose 전용 설명",
              "type": "basic",
              "name": "P",
              "if": "{{_global.identityChallenge?.purpose === 'nhnkcp.adult_verification'}}",
              "props": {
                "className": "text-label"
              },
              "text": "$t:sirsoft-verification_nhnkcp.modal.adult_description"
            },
            {
              "comment": "기본 본인확인 설명 (데스크톱)",
              "type": "basic",
              "name": "P",
              "if": "{{_global.identityChallenge?.purpose !== 'nhnkcp.adult_verification'}}",
              "props": {
                "className": "text-label"
              },
              "responsive": {
                "portable": {
                  "props": {
                    "className": "text-label hidden"
                  }
                }
              },
              "text": "$t:sirsoft-verification_nhnkcp.modal.description"
            },
            {
              "comment": "모바일 전용 안내 — 페이지가 인증 화면으로 이동함을 알린다",
              "type": "basic",
              "name": "P",
              "props": {
                "className": "text-label hidden"
              },
              "responsive": {
                "portable": {
                  "props": {
                    "className": "text-label"
                  }
                }
              },
              "text": "$t:sirsoft-verification_nhnkcp.modal.mobile_description"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "comment": "본인확인 시작 버튼 — 사용자 제스처 컨텍스트에서 window.open 호출 (팝업 차단 회피)",
          "type": "basic",
          "name": "Button",
          "props": {
            "type": "button",
            "className": "w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-4 py-3 bg-blue-600 dark:bg-blue-500 text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-700 dark:hover:bg-blue-600 font-semibold transition-colors"
          },
          "actions": [
            {
              "type": "click",
              "handler": "sirsoft-verification_nhnkcp.startAuth"
            }
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "basic",
              "name": "Span",
              "text": "$t:sirsoft-verification_nhnkcp.modal.start_button"
            },
            {
              "type": "basic",
              "name": "Icon",
              "props": {
                "name": "arrow-right",
                "className": "text-sm"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "comment": "테스트 모드 안내 — 운영자가 테스트 환경임을 즉시 식별할 수 있게 한다",
          "type": "basic",
          "name": "Div",
          "if": "{{_global.identityChallenge?.public_payload?.is_test_mode === true}}",
          "props": {
            "className": "p-2 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 rounded text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 text-center"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "basic",
              "name": "Span",
              "text": "$t:sirsoft-verification_nhnkcp.modal.test_mode_notice"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "comment": "진행 중 상태 — provider_id=nhnkcp && providerInProgress. 표준창이 열린 뒤 결과 대기",
      "type": "basic",
      "name": "Div",
      "if": "{{_global.identityChallenge?.provider_id === 'nhnkcp' && (_global.identityChallenge?.providerInProgress)}}",
      "props": {
        "className": "flex-center flex-col text-center space-y-4 py-6",
        "role": "status",
        "aria-live": "polite"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "basic",
          "name": "Icon",
          "props": {
            "name": "spinner",
            "className": "fa-spin text-3xl text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "basic",
          "name": "P",
          "props": {
            "className": "text-heading"
          },
          "text": "$t:sirsoft-verification_nhnkcp.modal.in_progress.title"
        },
        {
          "type": "basic",
          "name": "Div",
          "props": {
            "className": "p-3 bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-900/20 border border-amber-200 dark:border-amber-800 rounded text-xs text-yellow-700 dark:text-yellow-300"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "basic",
              "name": "Span",
              "props": {
                "className": "inline-flex items-start gap-1.5"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "basic",
                  "name": "Icon",
                  "props": {
                    "name": "circle-info",
                    "className": "mt-0.5"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": "basic",
                  "name": "Span",
                  "text": "$t:sirsoft-verification_nhnkcp.modal.in_progress.hint"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
